# Project Instructions

These instructions apply to all agents working in this repository.

## Running Shell Commands In Project

**IMPORTANT**: All shell commands must be executed from the project root directory.

## Run Project Locally

Run the following shell commands to run the project locally (agent + backend + frontend)

```shell
dr run dev
```

## MCP migration messages

Older versions of this template bundled an MCP server in `mcp_server/`. If a deploy stops with a message that starts with `MCP migration:`, show the message to the user. Don't continue the deploy: it would delete the user's old MCP server. Never set `MCP_MIGRATION_CONFIRMED` without the user's explicit answer. See `docs/mcp-migration.md`.

